    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MMWard Estate Agents are delighted to present this spacious and light filled two bedroom townhouse, ideally located just off the Newbridge Road in the private and well maintained Wentworth Place development.\n\nNo. 39 offers bright and well proportioned accommodation with three bathrooms, gas fired central heating, a spacious living room, a private rear garden accessed via patio doors, designated parking and a shared entrance serving just one neighbouring property.\n\nWentworth Place is a secure, gated development with generous green spaces and ample parking. Ideally positioned within a short walk of Naas Town Centre and its excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities, the property also enjoys superb connectivity with the N7/M7 motorway and Naas Ring Road close by.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious living room and a kitchen. Upstairs there are two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom\n\n.\n\nManagement Fee: 1,800 per annum."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\nIntercom, wooden flooring\n\nGuest WC - 3'6\" (1.07m) x 6'2\" (1.88m)\nTiles Floor, WC, WHB\n\nLiving room/Dining Room - 22'6\" (6.86m) x 11'5\" (3.48m)\nWooden floor, Feature fireplace with gas insert, Patio door to garden area, Phone point, TV point\n\nKitchen - 9'5\" (2.87m) x 6'9\" (2.06m)\nTiled floor, Part tiled walls, Oven, Hob, Extractor fan,Integrated fridge freezer,Integrated dishwasher, Integrated washer/dryer\n\nLanding\nAccess to attic, Hot press\n\nMaster bedroom - 12'8\" (3.86m) x 9'8\" (2.95m)\nBuilt in wardrobes, TV point\n\nBedroom 2 - 9'5\" (2.87m) x 9'2\" (2.79m)\nBuilt in wardrobes\n\nEn-Suite - 3'3\" (0.99m) x 8'5\" (2.57m)\nTiled Floor, Part tiled walls, walk in shower, WC, WHB, Fan\n\nBathroom - 7'10\" (2.39m) x 6'10\" (2.08m)\nTiled floor, Part tiled walls, Bath tub with shower mixer,Heated towel rail, WC, WHB\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
